(text "Bank L3: audio CODECs, buttons, LEDs" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 13.208 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9e77d34a-baf6-53a7-8126-05a33fdc8aed"))
(text "Bank L4: Ethernet RMII, host UART, sensor link, tamper switch" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 168.91 13.208 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "afb91cd5-6990-5e39-8430-c85e5e335cb8"))
(text "Bank L5: configuration flash, PSRAM, MicroSD, secure element, RTC, power control" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 135.128 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "87f70155-8eed-5e0c-961e-597dc42e67a1"))
(text "Per bank: 1x47u, 2x4u7, 4x470n, 2x100n (Table 2-3; the 47u count is reduced because all banks share +3V3)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5e85417f-5531-5293-bee0-147147bcaf0b"))
(text "Bank use (all banks at 3.3 V, LVCMOS33)\nL3  CODEC 1 and 2 (MCLK, I2S, I2C each), buttons, LEDs\nL4  RMII (ETH_REFCLK on a GMCLK ball), host UART, USB VBUS detect, sensor link, tamper switch.\n      Group 0 and the other VAA-capable balls are left free for analog use.\nL5  QSPI flash (dedicated D0-D3, FCS_N balls), IO_STATUS_C strap, 50 MHz SYS_CLK on a GMCLK ball,\n      PSRAM, MicroSD, secure-element I2C, RTC I2C, RTC_INT_N, PB_N, PWR_HOLD, PGOOD\nR4  LCD, 24-bit RGB (User Banks R page)\nR5  test and expansion header (User Banks R page)\nL6  no I/O bonded out in this package; VCCIOL6 is powered on the Power Supplies page\n\nNotes\n1. Master SPI x4 at 3.3 V needs VCCIOL5 = VCCIOCFG = 3.3 V; VCCIOL4 must not float (UG040012 Table 2-1).\n2. L5 balls RWSEL, CSO_DOUT, CS_N and ECCLKIN are configuration functions in other modes: left unused.\n3. Clock outputs (MCLK, LCD_PCLK) share a pair only with other outputs (UG040012 9.3).\n4. Loader-domain signals (flash, SD, PSRAM, secure element, RTC, Ethernet, UART, sensor) and\n   application-domain signals (CODECs, LCD, buttons, LEDs) are on separate banks or groups.\n5. Unused balls carry no-connect flags; the pin plan is a first pass and is free to change before layout.\n6. After the schematic is settled, run the pin plan through PDS to confirm it (UG040012 9.4)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d1a52aba-91bd-5c47-802a-edf64393867f"))
